# A scratch main.go at the repo root, ignored so manual testing does not get
# committed. Anchored with a leading slash on purpose: unanchored, `main.go`
# matches at ANY depth, which silently excluded tools/specvectors/main.go -- the
# generator for the committed spec-vector corpus. The corpus would have been
# committed without the program that produces it, and nothing would have said so
# until someone tried to regenerate it.
/main.go